2026-10-04T15:49:49.4792438Z     def test_a_bespoke_hole_is_priced_on_its_own_line_and_moves_no_tier(tmp_path):
2026-10-04T15:49:49.4792848Z         """Round 1 `loophole-1`, round 3 `loophole-1`. Both need a bespoke control's price to move
2026-10-04T15:49:49.4793290Z         something that a later removal or a cheaper replacement could move back. A bespoke hole is
2026-10-04T15:49:49.4793724Z         priced, on its own line, by the adopter's own scenario, and nothing reads that line: the
